  "summary": "Malicious code in @bx-ui-framework/common (npm)",
  "details": "The package declares a dependency resolved from a non-registry external host: \"common\": \"hxxps://repo[.]artifactorymanager[.]com/bx-ui-framework/common\". Installing the package causes npm to fetch and execute this dependency from the external Artifactory server rather than the npm registry, pulling third-party code into the install graph from a host outside the registry.",
